{
  "id": "LUK.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 13",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oapuuda riing'eegeagwa iimajameewa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda damandida gwanda Fiisu rukusa iita fuga Galilaya aguuyi Bilato foojeanda nyaawa sea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha nea gwayeesha, “Agooga ghoaghanyi gili fiisu bea Galilayaan gaba riing'a muuchi ea ghang'al fuga Galilaya suurja, aba gideaba gwasawaneatunu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geayeeshiineegwa, Manda; iimooduukuunani riing'eegeagwa eara agooga gajooshealda saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghana fugiga atamasis bea Siloamu meewa iing'adeesa gheeda geawiin, ghoaghanyi gideaba fiisu niramwas muuchi ea ghang'al buuneesean abiita Yerusalemu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda; geayeeshiineegwa, iimooduukuunani eara agooga gajooshealda gidashealda saawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gida sigala shaboogheecheanda manda haghweega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goobaloola galeega nea gwayeesha, “Sih ghayi gwandeawa shaboogheecheanda aba jeeda madamnyeandaanyi bea sabiibu, iidu gawa gagasa haghweega ak ea mwanyasa eara akaleala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha siida fur madamnyeanda, ‘Nih gweaydeaba samwagu gil nea geahitu dagasa haghweegeaba geedi ak ea mwaanyasi eara akaleala. Laksiina ng'eanyi, aba gideaba gaygweaksa naaha uurda sigeeda?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasha niny nea gwayeesha, ‘Siida mureeda, eanung'waada jeemba gwanyagi, ghanyi dabarsa nea ghayiinyi sururuuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iideepa gweanyiin gwaji haghweega abeeda ghoahiit; iideepa ea maji, abeeda gilaksi ng'eanyi.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoahaap gatmooda badeeda eaweeda Sabaato",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean eaweecha nea goonealshi aba jeeda ghooriida siinealshacheewa eaweeda sabaato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gwanda gatmooni sinyuut ng'utooschi meangeenda nea niiluul gweanyeew damasis, nea niighuumwa ea eamudu ghoamu gwadiiw geaw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daah Yesu gatmoodida gaguursa ak gwayeesha, “Iya siihaapnyi aba geeyooni ibearjeewiin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwayiin geatingaaschi uhuudeaba gatmoodida, deagheata gwadiiw geaw ak gwaduumsheesa ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwanyareas siida haw ahaaghwa ghooriida siinealshacheewa aba gideaba Yesu ghoahaap siida eaweeda Sabaato, hean gwayeesha buuneeda, “Goondeawi eawooji lah jea asinana gadiyeeda, asi apkaani eahaabeagwa askwearjoojisu, ak ea adoapkaanyi eaweeda Sabaato.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwasha Ng'utamiida nea gwayeesha, “Fuga amiitu geat! Aba agooga gwanda siida maygwajeassa heeydaanyi ghana digeadaanyi aba seamooda, eaweeda Sabaato ak gawa ghoaleayda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama ghamneawa gatmooni, was hudeaba Abrahamu nirada Shataani gweanyeew damasisiin, mamiisiina eetin aba ghealoonigaaschi eaweecheanji bea Sabaatohiin?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rugu ng'asheesu ghabwaspwas sean; gea gwachi sheang'nyi niny nea gahoosan buuneeda sean aba ng'asheega gheambiideadi sin niny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gida sigala ghajiileanda haradaali",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoanyaashta nea gwayeesha, “Ghamneawa sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA gawuurji sea naaha? Ak gaydagala naaha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji ghajiileanda geeta siguura haradaali geanu sih ak gwahista aba jeeda madamnyeandaanyi mwanang', ak gwardu ak gwaheedu ea ghoah geeta, inyeesa gwasin damealga ea gwasissa dariidaka ghoorajeega nyaawa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gida sigala hamiira",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gabiikta gicha gwayeesha, “Gaydagala naaha sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji sea hamiireeda geanu gatmooda ak ghwayiin jeemba sooscheew samwagu bea dearanga, ak ghwanung' ghaghuut geat sean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidaghuuta mwariis",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat gawa nea gwasik mujiinajeega ea gharang'weaka, goonealshi nea gagal Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoanyaash siida nea gwayeesha, “Ng'utamiida fuga jea ghwalaalaan gajeang'ayi?” Hean gwayeesha saawa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Amilmiliita ak goosikchi gidaghuuta mwanang'; aba gideaba geayeeshiineegwa, gaygagasa fuga saang'a gwasik ak ea mayghoamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gayghwahidu damanda jea ghang'eat siida bea gheeda ak ghwajap gidaghuuta, hean goobissi amiinaada ak googulguli gidaghuuta, nea gooyeenyi, ‘Ng'utamiida, jaaseasa.’ Ak gayghwasha niny nea gwayeesha, ‘Mwaanali heedooleabu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajayeeshiina, ‘Aseasa ghayi geembuutooschi nea geeleeshachi sea ang'iing'i nea giinealshachi aba mujiineedeanya.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaygwayeesha, ‘Geayeeshiineegwa, mwaanali heedooleabu, ang'amwana heedeanyu, agoogeeni sina ng'asheega munyasiin!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gayghwahidu shooka ea giiwiirooda geeshatka, iyoadaayi Abrahamu ea Isaka ea Yakobo ea sibanga sean aba jeeda sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA nea agooga ea sihisaneegwa jarooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gay ghapka fuga jea gwaleabu heeda ghayeawa ea heeda biyeara, ea wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa ea wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara, ak gaygweagiischi aba jeeda sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ang'ula fuga huuydean gayghoah fuga madeeda, nea fuga madeeda gayghoah fuga huuydean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bariinyeega Yesu bea Yerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba damandida ghapka headaanyi Farisaayajeesu ng'ay ak gwayeesha, “Ng'amwana hiji, aba gideaba Herode gagasa gwanuusnyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha saawa, “Aweayeena ak gooyeeshi fureayoodida, ‘Ng'ula askweareani ea numuji gaydearuuta meangeenda nea ghaahaapchi fuga miyeani, eaweedeaba samwagu gaydaahiit gadiyeedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara gwasa gamiisean daang'waay naweedeanyu askweareani ghanea numuji ghanea niseerida; aba gideaba mamiisiina gideaba gajeenuuksa sibaneeda heeda mawoosa Yerusalemu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea Yerusalemu, Yerusalemu, gibarayi sibanga nea giftayi aba lagheanga fuga siicheagu headaang'u! Neagasayi niba hada damuughuushta diibigaagu gida amuguuriida nghaghooda dayeagaaschi aba jeesinga meang'eagaaschi, ak ghoaheawi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'ula, ghaheang'wa sinung'usa heeda. Ak geayeeshiineegwa, maygudu abiikta adaahaan ea eaghus ayeena, ‘Sibadiischeesa siida wuna gheawunga Ng'utamiida!’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.13.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
